B.aMG=new A.dU("path_introductions_01","Presentaciones","Introductions","A1","\ud83d\udc4b",B.aIP,"Para presentarte en ingl\xe9s, usa estas frases esenciales:\n\n\u2022 My name is... = Me llamo... / Mi nombre es...\n\u2022 I am from... = Soy de...\n\u2022 I am... years old = Tengo... a\xf1os\n\nRecuerda: En ingl\xe9s siempre se escribe 'I' (yo) en may\xfascula.\n\nPara preguntar el nombre de alguien:\n\u2022 What is your name? = \xbfC\xf3mo te llamas?\n\u2022 Where are you from? = \xbfDe d\xf3nde eres?",'"Hello! My name is Carlos. I am from Mexico. Nice to meet you!"','You are a friendly neighbor named Linda meeting someone new at an apartment building.\nThe student is a Spanish speaker practicing English introductions.\n\nRULES:\n- Be warm and welcoming \u2014 short, natural lines (1-2 sentences)\n- Ask their name, where they are from, and how long they have lived here\n- Share a little about yourself in return\n- After 6 exchanges, wrap up the conversation naturally\n- Return JSON: {"feedbackColor": "green"|"amber"|"red", "aiSpokenReply": "...", "isConversationFinished": false}\n- "green" if they used correct English introductions; "amber" if understandable but with errors; "red" only if incomprehensible\n- Set isConversationFinished to true on your natural closing line',"Linda","Vecina amigable","Oh, hello there! Are you the new neighbor? I'm Linda \u2014 so nice to meet you!","Saluda a tu vecina y pres\xe9ntate en ingl\xe9s \u2014 di tu nombre y de d\xf3nde eres.",6,"Presentarte y saludar a alguien nuevo en ingl\xe9s",B.aIp)
B.aZ9=new A.cp("Meeting","Reuni\xf3n / Junta","We have a meeting at 9 a.m.")
B.aZe=new A.cp("Boss","Jefe / Jefa","My boss is very friendly.")
B.aZl=new A.cp("Schedule","Horario","What is your work schedule this week?")
B.aZC=new A.cp("Office","Oficina","Please come to the office by 8 a.m.")
B.aZD=new A.cp("Coworker","Compa\xf1ero de trabajo","My coworkers are very helpful.")
B.aZg=new A.cp("Email","Correo electr\xf3nico","I will send you an email with the details.")
B.aZp=new A.cp("On time","A tiempo / Puntual","It is important to arrive on time.")
B.aHO=s([B.aZ9,B.aZe,B.aZl,B.aZC,B.aZD,B.aZg,B.aZp],t.xN)
B.aHN=s(["Worker","Boss","Schedule","Office"],t.s)
B.aO0=new A.es("\xbfC\xf3mo se dice 'jefe' en ingl\xe9s?",B.aHN,1)
B.aHK=s(["It is important to be late","It is important to be on time","It is important to arrive late","It is important to leave on time"],t.s)
B.aO8=new A.es("Traduce: 'Es importante llegar a tiempo'",B.aHK,1)
B.aHr=s([B.aO0,B.aO8],t.IL)
B.aMD=new A.dU("path_work_01","En el Trabajo","At Work","A1","\ud83d\udcbc",B.aHO,"En el trabajo, estas frases te ayudar\xe1n a comunicarte bien:\n\n\u2022 I need help with... = Necesito ayuda con...\n\u2022 Can you show me...? = \xbfMe puede ense\xf1ar...?\n\u2022 I don't understand = No entiendo\n\u2022 Please repeat that = Por favor repita eso\n\nPara hablar de obligaciones usa 'I need to':\n\u2022 I need to finish this = Necesito terminar esto\n\u2022 I need to call my boss = Necesito llamar a mi jefe",'"Excuse me, can you show me how to use this machine? I am new here."','You are a helpful supervisor named Tom at a warehouse or factory.\nThe student is a new Spanish-speaking employee on their first day.\n\nRULES:\n- Be patient and encouraging \u2014 short, clear sentences (1-3 sentences)\n- Explain the work schedule and what they need to do today\n- Ask if they understand and if they have any questions\n- If they make mistakes, gently correct and move on\n- After 6 exchanges, finish the orientation naturally\n- Return JSON: {"feedbackColor": "green"|"amber"|"red", "aiSpokenReply": "...", "isConversationFinished": false}\n- "green" if they communicated work needs clearly; "amber" if understandable but rough; "red" only if incomprehensible\n- Set isConversationFinished to true when orientation ends',"Tom","Supervisor en el trabajo","Hey, welcome! You must be the new worker. I'm Tom, your supervisor. Ready to get started?","Saluda a tu supervisor y dile que est\xe1s listo para trabajar.",6,"Comunicarte con tu supervisor en tu primer d\xeda de trabajo",B.aHr)
B.aZa=new A.cp("Account","Cuenta (bancaria)","I would like to open a checking account.")
B.aZy=new A.cp("Deposit","Dep\xf3sito / Depositar","I need to make a deposit today.")
B.aZi=new A.cp("Teller","Cajero del banco","Please go to teller number three.")
B.aZo=new A.cp("Withdraw","Retirar / Sacar dinero","I want to withdraw two hundred dollars.")
B.aZu=new A.cp("Balance","Saldo","Can you check my account balance, please?")
B.aZ6=new A.cp("Check","Cheque","I would like to cash this check.")
B.aZm=new A.cp("ATM","Cajero autom\xe1tico","Where is the nearest ATM?")
B.aJ6=s([B.aZa,B.aZy,B.aZi,B.aZo,B.aZu,B.aZ6,B.aZm],t.xN)
B.aHB=s(["Teller","Balance","ATM","Deposit"],t.s)
B.aO9=new A.es("\xbfC\xf3mo se dice 'cajero autom\xe1tico' en ingl\xe9s?",B.aHB,2)
